    "detailed_description": "Control a group of stranded survivors trying to stay afloat in a flooded world. Build up the perfect island colony, keep your survivors happy, and protect them from dangers on land and sea!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/2aa8de77c8d5e797daf7c702bd03d349.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=53 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE ON FLOATING ISLANDS</strong></h2>Island life is not all sunshine and coconuts. With sparse resources and limited island space, planning will be essential as you construct workstations, manage food production and secure drinkable water - all while making sure your island refuge stays above water.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Raft Crafting</h2>Design and build your own raft! Start small with a simple paddle, then research large rafts with bigger engines that can haul islands to your home colony.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.poster.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.webm?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.mp4?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay Afloat, with Buoyancy Tech</h2>Re-discover island buoyancy technology from a mysterious pre-flood corporation. Construct early warning systems and research Float-Tech contraptions to keep your islands afloat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.poster.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.webm?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.mp4?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on Expeditions!</h2>One tiny island won't be enough for long term survival... Send survivors on expeditions to collect resources from different biomes. Gather what you can before the islands sink or float away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/54de0018ef34130a9ae9f02146732613.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Sea Spirits Up</h2>Motivation is the key to survival! Keep a close eye on hunger, thirst, tiredness, comfort and other needs, or you'll find survivors slacking off, or leaving your group! Take advantage of each Oceaneer\u2019s skills and traits to create an efficient island community.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/06f05bf0e7746f62f57ff8b0987e9c8a.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend Off Threats Above and Below</h2>Protect your colony from harsh weather, and threats on land and sea. Fortify your rafts, weather-proof your buildings and set up countermeasures against food-stealing seagulls, foot-pinching crabs and raft-wrecking sharks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/53a1778be06892c74f10aa546ee1a7e7.poster.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/53a1778be06892c74f10aa546ee1a7e7.webm?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/53a1778be06892c74f10aa546ee1a7e7.mp4?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Deep Sea Secrets</h2>Learn the truth of the sinking islands. Uncover hidden clues, find lost artifacts and discover tales from lost Oceaneers. But beware... some mysteries are best left underwater!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>\u25cf Control multiple characters in this single player experience.<br>\u25cf Design multiple rafts and send survivors on expeditions.<br>\u25cf Haul islands back to your colony to expand your island home.<br>\u25cf Improve island buoyancy with contraptions that keep islands afloat.<br>\u25cf Research and unlock advanced workstations and upgrades.<br>\u25cf Survive against weather events, and threats on both land and sea.<br>\u25cf Farm crops, prepare rations and cook meals.<br>\u25cf Customize your survivor names, traits, hair styles... including beards &amp; mustaches!<br>\u25cf Uncover the deep sea storyline plot alongside the survival journey.",
    "about_the_game": "Control a group of stranded survivors trying to stay afloat in a flooded world. Build up the perfect island colony, keep your survivors happy, and protect them from dangers on land and sea!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/2aa8de77c8d5e797daf7c702bd03d349.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=53 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE ON FLOATING ISLANDS</strong></h2>Island life is not all sunshine and coconuts. With sparse resources and limited island space, planning will be essential as you construct workstations, manage food production and secure drinkable water - all while making sure your island refuge stays above water.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Raft Crafting</h2>Design and build your own raft! Start small with a simple paddle, then research large rafts with bigger engines that can haul islands to your home colony.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.poster.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.webm?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/1a0a2d61a22ea59b253c14161068e52d.mp4?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay Afloat, with Buoyancy Tech</h2>Re-discover island buoyancy technology from a mysterious pre-flood corporation. Construct early warning systems and research Float-Tech contraptions to keep your islands afloat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.poster.avif?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.webm?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/15401e5bf57161d3d0e0f41e68b1c9eb.mp4?t=1753369880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/03d47e3c7a21de429605f9a0fe837554.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=20 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on Expeditions!</h2>One tiny island won't be enough for long term survival... Send survivors on expeditions to collect resources from different biomes. Gather what you can before the islands sink or float away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/964e3b2fedea68241a47d5f00fa9f846.webp?t=1753369880\" width=600 height=3 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052510/extras/54de0018ef34130a9ae9f02146732613.avif?t=1753369880\" widt